message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "HiLRP: conservation-valid attribution for hierarchical and hybrid Vision Transformers"
abstract: >-
  A conservation-valid attribution framework for hierarchical and hybrid vision
  transformers, formulated as relevance flow on a multi-resolution token graph,
  together with a controlled cross-architecture benchmark of 14 attribution
  methods over 10 backbones.
